# API keys — copy this file to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.

# General Hugging Face token — gated base downloads and optional publishing.
HF_TOKEN=

# Upstream's full-model Krea 2 CLOUD training token. This fork has no rented-GPU
# lane, so nothing reads it here — left in place only to keep the file aligned
# with upstream's. Setting it enables nothing; leave it empty.
HF_CLOUD_TOKEN=

# Pexels API key — required for Pexels scans through the official API.
# Create one for free at https://www.pexels.com/api/key/ (200 requests/hour, 20,000/month).
# IMPORTANT: An API key alone does not authorize dataset or machine-learning use.
# Configure/use this integration only if Pexels has explicitly authorized this use case.
# Official terms: https://help.pexels.com/hc/en-us/articles/900005880463-What-are-the-Terms-and-Conditions
PEXELS_API_KEY=

# Civitai API key — optional, free, and used by TWO features that share it:
# the scraper (without a key a Civitai scan returns SFW results only) and the
# 🌐 top-prompt browser in the Test Studio (without a key the top images still
# browse, but Civitai publishes no generation prompt to read). Also settable in
# Settings → Scraping & sources, which writes it here.
CIVITAI_API_KEY=
